WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
Add a recording

00:04.000 --> 00:08.950
Split it into steps where the explanation changes

00:08.950 --> 00:17.880
Type captions right on the preview

00:17.880 --> 00:23.450
For a zoom, draw a box around the area to show

00:23.450 --> 00:30.660
Play it back to check on the spot

00:30.660 --> 00:35.680
Boxes and arrows go on the preview too

00:35.680 --> 00:38.880
Click Export

00:38.880 --> 00:41.930
Wait for the export to finish (sped up)

00:41.930 --> 00:44.193
The mp4 is ready
